Title: The Wurzels end gig abruptly as band members fall ill
Date: 2025-07-14
Firsthand information: {'Speaker': [{'Speaker': 'Tommy Banner', 'Text': 'Both Pete and I appear to have fully recovered from sun and heat exhaustion. Up on stage there was no air moving and we were facing straight into the direct, unobstructed rays of a very strong sun.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 2, 'StartChar': 131, 'EndChar': 313}}, {'Speaker': 'Tommy Banner', 'Text': 'I was about to announce the last song and Pete wasn’t besides me where he normally is. He was in a bad way.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 4, 'StartChar': 17, 'EndChar': 116}}, {'Speaker': 'Tommy Banner', 'Text': 'Both Pete and I appear to have fully recovered from sun and heat exhaustion.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 2, 'StartChar': 131, 'EndChar': 198}}], 'Description': [{'Description': 'The Wurzels had to end their gig abruptly because the band\'s singer was "in a bad way" as temperatures peaked at 31C.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 1, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 90}}, {'Description': 'Pete Budd, who turns 85 on 18 July, had to leave Party at the Palace stage in Wells, Somerset, on Saturday before the end of the set.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 2, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 114}}, {'Description': 'Accordionist Tommy Banner said he also felt sunstroke and experienced dizziness after going off stage.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 2, 'StartChar': 115, 'EndChar': 130}}, {'Description': 'Mr Banner and Mr Budd were supported by medical staff when they left the stage.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 3, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 71}}, {'Description': 'A nurse then arrived and checked both band members over, gave Mr Banner some exercises to do, and advised him not to drive.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 6, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 111}}], 'Image': [{'ID': 'image_1', 'Caption': "Pete Budd from The Wurzels dressed in a white shirt with brown waistcoat, holding a banjo and singing into a mic. There's stage set and lights behind him inside a green lit marquee"}]}
